  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You and your eidolon are always alert for danger.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Vigilant Eidolon<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain the benefits of this feat as long as your eidolon is within 5 feet times your mythic tier. If your eidolon is adjacent to you, you add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) to the Perception bonus you gain from your eidolon, and your eidolon gains a bonus equal to one-half the bonus you gain. If either of you is aware of an opponent, both of you are aware of that opponent. If either of you is not surprised, both of you may act during the surprise round.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-t-z-feats#toc28\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
